    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665720/extras/55fc1276e939649bcf0c75be3dc4dce8.avif?t=1706140712\" /></div><br><strong>Woah, wasn't this previous called &quot;Fool's Gold: Dice, Death &amp; Dating&quot;?</strong><br>You're right! Fool's Gold: Dice, Death &amp; Dating has been rebranded to Fool's Gold: SOULBREAKER, an action-packed hack'n'slash roguelite with all your favorite characters. It adds a ton more gameplay onto what we presented in the previous demo, so we felt it was right to rename the game to better reflect this.<br><br><strong>What is SOULBREAKER</strong><br>SOULBREAKER is a D&amp;D-inspired, humorous rogue-lite where you hack'n'slash your way through an ever-changing infected world.<br>Fight, befriend, smooch, or <i>sacrifice</i> your way through the ever-changing jungle of the Bellowing Wilds.<br><br>On your adventure you will face new monsters, find new items, and determine the fate of the jungle's inhabitants.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665720/extras/a695a3422ab149e4c073f51ad1c7db8f.poster.avif?t=1706140712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665720/extras/a695a3422ab149e4c073f51ad1c7db8f.webm?t=1706140712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A diverse cast of characters<br></li><li>Tight Hack'n'Slash Roguelite gameplay<br></li><li>Ever-changing dungeons<br></li><li>Quirky items<br></li><li>Character progression<br></li><li>Hand-drawn &amp; animated artwork<br></li><li>Lots of humor<br></li><li>Monke<br></li><li>And more to be revealed!</li></ul><br>For now we've left the previous Dice, Death &amp; Dating demo linked to this app, so you can still enjoy it while we tinker on the new game!<br><br>SIGN UP FOR THE KICKSTARTER NEWSLETTER",
